Emerging Market Opportunities
The growing deployment of battery energy storage systems creates opportunities for specialist laboratories offering cell-level, unit-level, and installation-level testing. Providers with advanced fire-testing facilities and experience in recognised testing protocols can address increasingly complex customer requirements.

The introduction of updated UL 9540A testing approaches also creates opportunities for expanded installation-level fire scenarios and technical assessment. Additional demand may emerge from project-specific fire and gas characterisation, independent verification, and recurring technical support.

